sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant APP as Android app (WebView)
    participant BR as System browser (Custom Tab)
    participant SB as Supabase and Google
    participant API as Backend
    U->>APP: Tap "Continue with Google"
    APP->>SB: signInWithOAuth (redirect to skillkart://auth-callback)
    APP->>BR: Open the consent URL
    BR->>SB: User approves
    SB-->>BR: Redirect to skillkart://auth-callback#access_token
    BR-->>APP: Android hands the URL back (intent filter)
    APP->>BR: Close the Custom Tab
    APP->>APP: Navigate to /auth/consent with the URL fragment
    APP->>API: POST /auth/supabase-auth with the access token
    API->>SB: Verify the token server-side
    SB-->>API: Verified identity
    API-->>APP: SkillKart access and refresh tokens
